---
title: sd MF-05b: Early Resignation Claim During Warranty & Free Replacement Slot
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CL as Client Company User
  participant API as FinanceEndpoints
  participant H as Report / Resolve Resignation Handlers
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor HR as Internal HR
  actor AF as Affiliate
  CL->>API: POST /api/v1/placements/{id}/resignation (LastWorkingDate, Reason)
  API->>H: Send(ReportResignationCommand)
  H->>DB: Update Warranty -> CLAIMED & Commission -> ON_HOLD
  H-->>HR: Notify Internal HR to verify resignation claim
  API-->>CL: 200 OK (Warranty Claim Recorded)
  HR->>API: POST /api/v1/placements/{id}/resignation/resolve (Confirmed, Note)
  API->>H: Send(ResolveResignationCommand)
  alt Confirmed == true (Candidate Left During Warranty)
    H->>DB: Update Warranty -> VOIDED, Placement -> LEFT_DURING_WARRANTY
    H->>DB: Update Commission -> CANCELLED & open ReplacementSlot (OPEN / WAITING_PAYMENT)
    H-->>AF: Notify Affiliate: Commission cancelled due to early resignation
    API-->>HR: 200 OK (Replacement Slot Opened)
  else Confirmed == false (Claim Rejected)
    H->>DB: Restore Warranty -> ACTIVE & Commission -> IN_WARRANTY
    H-->>AF: Notify Affiliate: Warranty restored
    API-->>HR: 200 OK (Warranty Restored)
  end
